<p>Someone asked to reset the CertTrack password for <%= @user.email_address %>.</p>

<p><%= link_to "Choose a new password", edit_password_url(@user.password_reset_token) %></p>

<p>
  This link expires in <%= distance_of_time_in_words(0, @user.password_reset_token_expires_in) %>.
  If you didn't ask for this, ignore this email; your password stays the same.
</p>
